{"html_text": {"ja228:0.1": "<article id='ja228'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja228:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja228:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja228:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja228:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja228:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja228:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja228:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja228:2.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja228:2.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja228:2.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja228:2.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja228:3.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja228:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja228:0.2": "Dukanipāta ", "ja228:0.3": "Kāsāvavagga ", "ja228:0.4": "8. Kāmanītajātaka ", "ja228:1.1": "“Tayo giriṁ antaraṁ kāmayāmi, ", "ja228:1.2": "Pañcālā kuruyo kekake ca; ", "ja228:1.3": "Tatuttariṁ brāhmaṇa kāmayāmi, ", "ja228:1.4": "Tikiccha maṁ brāhmaṇa kāmanītaṁ”. ", "ja228:2.1": "“Kaṇhāhidaṭṭhassa karonti heke, ", "ja228:2.2": "Amanussapaviṭṭhassa karonti paṇḍitā; ", "ja228:2.3": "Na kāmanītassa karoti koci, ", "ja228:2.4": "Okkantasukkassa hi kā tikicchā”ti. ", "ja228:3.1": "Kāmanītajātakaṁ aṭṭhamaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja228:0.1": "", "ja228:0.2": "", "ja228:0.3": "", "ja228:0.4": "", "ja228:1.1": "", "ja228:1.2": "", "ja228:1.3": "Tatuttariṁ → taduttariṁ (mr) ", "ja228:1.4": "", "ja228:2.1": "", "ja228:2.2": "Amanussapaviṭṭhassa → amanussavaddhassa (bj, pts-vp-pli1); amanussaviṭṭhassa (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja228:2.3": "", "ja228:2.4": "", "ja228:3.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja228:0.1": "", "ja228:0.2": "", "ja228:0.3": "", "ja228:0.4": "", "ja228:1.1": "bj30.110, ms22J_591, msdiv155, ndp22.58, pts-vp-pli2.214", "ja228:1.2": "", "ja228:1.3": "", "ja228:1.4": "", "ja228:2.1": "dr27.86, ms22J_592, msdiv156, pts-vp-pli2.215, sya27.87", "ja228:2.2": "", "ja228:2.3": "", "ja228:2.4": "", "ja228:3.1": "ms2